        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Boundaries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Browser never receives DB credentials or secret/service key. All order writes go through API.&lt;br&gt;Tracking polls authenticated API every 5–10s; private responses no-store.&lt;br&gt;Business rules live in one modular NestJS service layer. No Redis/broker in MVP." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="770" width="1350" height="140" as="geometry" />
